        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:276.72119140625,213.9389190673828,1905.9775390625,2642.061080932617",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<p><i>Registration mark on left</i></p>\n\n<ol><li>Let it be registered in the office of accounts,</li>\n<li>if God wills.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">They have registered the amount of three, a half, a third and a sixteenth.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God, with the praise of those who give thanks.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">A valid receipt has been granted to them in al-\u0160\u016bbays, on behalf of 'Ab\u016b al-\u1e24asan ibn Wahb the estate-manager</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for the year four-hundred and three, under the supervision of the auspicious, rightly-guided judge, \u1e6eiqat al-Mulk</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Mak\u012bn al-Dawla wa-\u02beAm\u012bnuh\u0101, the prot\u00e9g\u00e9 of the commander of the faithful, \u02beAb\u016b\u00a0 al-\u1e24asan \u02bfAl\u012b ibn Bah\u0101r, and in the presence of</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the trusted judge \u02beAb\u016b \u02beAl\u012b al-\u1e24asan ibn Ya\u1e25y\u0101 ibn Bah\u0101r, his deputy,\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">with the elder Sad\u012bd al-Dawla \u02beAb\u016b al-Faraj \u02bfAbd al-Mas\u012b\u1e25 ibn Q\u016br\u012bl acting as accountant.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Half of this: One, a half, a quarter and an eighth. Its amount: Three, a half, a third\u00a0 and a sixteenth.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Written by M\u012b\u1e35\u0101\u02beil ibn \u02bfAbd al-Masi\u1e25 the, cashier. Valid. The twenty-second of Jum\u0101d\u0101 II,\u00a0</li>\n<li>in the year four-hundred and three.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
